.env
node_modules/
client/node_modules/
client/dist/
data/
!data/*.json
# `data/` above is unanchored, so it also swallowed packages/ats-scorer/data — the scorer's
# registries — and the package would have committed without them (A1, 2026-09-27).
!packages/ats-scorer/data/
# D151 Rule 5: the scale fixtures (scripts/scaleFixture.mjs) — 450 MB at 100k, ≈ 2.3 GB at 500k; always rebuilt, never committed.
tmp/scale-*/
env.sh


# Temporary safety net while the owner moves these OUT of the repository (10-01); remove once they are gone.
docs/business/
docs/COMPANY_AND_MONETISATION.md

# D198 E4 (47h): the explainer exports (MP4s) - the owner posts them; scripts/d198Export.mjs re-renders them
content/explainers/*/export/

# D198 E3 (47h): the Piper runtime + voice model (114 MB) - downloaded per docs/explainers/voice.md, never committed
tmp/piper-dl/
